Z||000000||frontal lobe||03-29-2001||12:36 AM||||Just wondering how many of you macho dudes can "one-hand" the steering wheel.  Without power steering, I just can't do it.  I have a turn into a parking lot that I have to use a "key card" for.  So I'm trying to make the turn into the lot with one hand and power down the window with the other (9 months of winter here, so I like to put down the window at the last moment) and I just can't do the turn with one arm.  Definitely 2 hands on the wheel for me when turning, instead of the preferred one hand on the wheel and one hand on the stick shift.  How about the rest of you.<P>P.S.  I do have access to anabolic steroids, but would prefer not to use them. j/k||||reg||1
