Z||000004||fierosound||03-29-2001||01:04 AM||||The tires you have will also make a difference in  steering effort, as well as their size.  I had the original Goodyears and Toyos earlier.  Once I went to Michelins, I noticed significantly less steering effort was required.  Tires sizes were always the same on the front 205/60/15s.  I recently went to Michelin 205/55/16s and it's still pretty good.||||reg||10
